          <div class="section-header is-visible">
            <h2>The end of trusted hardware.</h2>
            <p>Hardware wallets force you to trust a manufacturer and a global supply chain. Lock removes that entirely. Experience institutional-grade security built from the ground up to turn any device you already own into a dedicated, offline signing machine.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-grid">
            
            <div class="card col-7 is-visible">
              <div class="card-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"></line></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>True Air-Gapped Security</h3>
              <p>Your private keys and seeds exist only on your dedicated offline Signer. The Wallet app securely sends unsigned transactions to the Signer via QR, Bluetooth, or local WiFi, receives them back signed, and broadcasts them via the Node. Zero internet contact for your core seed.</p>
              
              <div class="tech-list">
                <div class="tech-item"><span>Supported Blockchains</span><span>117+ Natively Supported</span></div>
                <div class="tech-item"><span>Compatible Ecosystems</span><span>EVM, UTXO, Solana, Cosmos, Polkadot</span></div>
                <div class="tech-item"><span>Network Architecture</span><span>Decentralized Node Mesh</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card col-5 is-visible">
              <div class="card-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Private End-to-End Chat</h3>
              <p>Communicate securely with an end-to-end encrypted messaging system using post-quantum hybrid cryptography. Send DMs, manage group messaging, and seamlessly transfer files up to 100 MB directly through the node infrastructure.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card col-6 is-visible">
              <div class="card-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Decentralized Cloud &amp; Apps</h3>
              <p>Access a full decentralized storage pipeline. Package, sign, and store your immutable data natively via Filecoin without third-party reliance. You can even deploy and interact with smart contracts directly from the interface.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card col-6 is-visible">
              <div class="card-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Future-Proof Cryptography</h3>
              <p>Engineered for the post-Shor era. Lock utilizes integrated ML-DSA-65 signatures and ML-KEM-768 key encapsulation. A hardened 6-layer key derivation process prepares your assets to defend against quantum threats.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card col-12 is-visible">
              <div class="card-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Universal Quantum Seed</h3>
              <p>Forget standard seed phrases. We utilize 256 universal icons mapped to 42 languages. Write your backup in English, recover it in Japanese. Generated with 272-bit Quantum-Safe Entropy to survive Grover's algorithm with a massive post-quantum security margin.</p>
              
              <div class="seed-showcase">
                <div class="seed-icon-box"><span class="emoji">🐶</span><span class="num">001</span></div>
                <div class="seed-icon-box"><span class="emoji">☀️</span><span class="num">002</span></div>
